WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.475 --> 00:00:02.025
Meet Walter.

2
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:05.550
Walter is a modern man.

3
00:00:06.525 --> 00:00:11.950
Each morning, Walter checks a small glass rectangle to learn how he feels.

4
00:00:12.975 --> 00:00:14.775
Notice his posture.

5
00:00:15.775 --> 00:00:20.750
Good posture helps Walter read what strangers think about a sandwich.

6
00:00:21.725 --> 00:00:25.925
At work, Walter attends a meeting to schedule a meeting.

7
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:28.700
Well done, Walter.

8
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:34.350
In the evening, the family gathers together, each member alone.

9
00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:42.950
Walter's doctor recommends more sleep, so Walter watches a video about sleep until two in the morning.

10
00:00:43.925 --> 00:00:47.175
You may be wondering if Walter is happy.

11
00:00:48.125 --> 00:00:50.500
He is watching this right now.

12
00:00:51.475 --> 00:00:53.400
Go to bed, Walter.
